28
00:01:54,415 --> 00:01:57,915
Start with your camera. Allow.

29
00:01:57,915 --> 00:02:02,515
Moti: First, let's roast the peanuts. Remember to keep it on a low flame.

30
00:02:02,615 --> 00:02:04,115
Moti: What should you do next?

31
00:02:04,215 --> 00:02:07,515
Kiran: How long do I keep it on a low flame?

32
00:02:07,515 --> 00:02:10,015
Moti: Sauté the onion until it turns a reddish colour.

33
00:02:10,015 --> 00:02:12,015
Moti: What comes after the onions are sautéed?

34
00:02:12,515 --> 00:02:18,015
Kiran: I think I add the peanuts to the sautéed onion.

35
00:02:19,515 --> 00:02:20,515
Moti: That's exactly right.

36
00:02:20,515 --> 00:02:24,215
Moti: Once the onion is reddish, add your spices and the crushed peanuts.

37
00:02:24,315 --> 00:02:32,686
The same loop works at a desk. Moti watches an expert's screen, and asks why at the right moment.

38
00:02:32,986 --> 00:02:41,597
The Work Map keeps every reason in the expert's own words, and labels anything the AI inferred.

39
